---
import BrainData from "./BrainData.astro";
---

<div
  class="flex justify-around py-24 max-w-8xl flex-col lg:flex-row p-8 gap-16"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col lg:max-w-md gap-2 justify-center">
    <h1 class="font-roboto font-medium text-black leading-4 tracking-widest">
      HOW IT WORKS
    </h1>
    <h2
      class="text-[#4F7363FF] text-[30px] font-inter tracking-wider font-semibold pr-2"
    >
      MokaDex integrates nature's knowledge with cutting edge technology
    </h2>
    <p
      class="text-[#BBBBBBFF] xl:text-[24px] font-inter font-medium lg:text-[18px] leading-12 lg:pr-16"
    >
      MokaDex is our proprietary AI engine that serves as the digital architect for Moka’s Operating System. 
      By transforming billions of years of plant evolution into a searchable database, 
      it identifies novel bioactive molecules and their mechanisms of action with unprecedented speed.
    </p>
  </div>
  <BrainData />
</div>
